"id": 1}, {"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "documented", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": "their whole life online.", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}], "id": 2}, {"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "ingrained", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "I'm glad my parents", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": "in me the habit of getting out and doing things", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}], "id": 3}, {"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "devices", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}, {"text": "", "id": 2, "_data": [{"content": "assertion ", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"text": "", "id": 3, "_data": [{"content": "deliver", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "rather than letting me overuse my electronic ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": ".", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}], "id": 4}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Janice shares her opinion on technology. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Move the words from the box to correctly complete the sentences. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": 2, "type": "template_override"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}]}], "id": 10, "stimuli_ids": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "RSLT", "questions": [{"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le16ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le16ob03re2img02.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn10le16ob03re2img02.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn10le16ob03re2img02.jpg", "text": "If it weren't for the stress people put on documenting their every move, they would be living their lives. They are not. If it weren't for the need to demonstrate what they were doing or seeing rather than just doing or seeing, everything would be different. Had it not been ingrained in them, children wouldn't be snapping cell phone selfies of themselves with friends and texting about it rather than speaking to them.\n<br>\nWere it not for the internet, I would see these same children playing. I do not.  I would have been part of this trend but for the constant assertion of my parents that I should not be tempted to publish my life to the world. If it hadn't been for my choice to live rather than document, I probably wouldn't be writing this now.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn10le16ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "By contrast, an acquaintance of mine documents continuously. By the time she finishes university, she will have catalogued every outfit she has worn. She will have been posting pictures of every beau, complete with comments. By graduation day, she'll have been tweeting about every class, or function she had been to.\n<br>\nIt wouldn't surprise me to hear, one day in the future, - 'You won't have seen yet, of course, but Stacey has actually selfied her way through her own wedding!' or 'You won't have gotten the video of Stacey delivering her son, of course. I'll send it along to you now'  - and have it all forwarded to me before I can say please don't!", "id": 2, "time": "46500"}, {"image": "engenn10le16ob03re2img03.jpg", "text": "Don't get me wrong. I do go online. I write e-mails and glance at MeBook pages with friends even though I don't MeBook myself. The difference is that by the end of my life, I will literally have experienced it, rather than just seen pictures of it!", "id": 3, "time": "89500"}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "A Brave New World", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Living Online", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 16, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Describe necessity, duty, advice, or strong disapproval in written and spoken situations according to work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information, including specialized articles of the professional or academic life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to document", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to \u200brecord \u200binformation about ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If it weren't for the stress people put on documenting their every move, they would be living their lives.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le16ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about taking selfies.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ingrained", "type": "name"}, {"content": "well-established", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Had it not been ingrained in them, children wouldn't be snapping cell phone selfies.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le16ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": " assertion", "type": "name"}, {"content": "statement strongly believed to be true", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I would have been part of this trend but for the constant assertion of my parents that I should not be tempted to publish my life to the world.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le16ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to catalog ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "make a systematic list", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: By the time she finishes university, she will have catalogued every outfit she has worn. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le16ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to post ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to put something on the internet for others to see", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She will have been posting pictures of every beau, complete with comments.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le16ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to deliver (a baby) ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to give birth", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You won't have gotten the video of Stacey delivering her son, of course.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le16ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "literally", "type": "name"}, {"content": "truly; actually", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The difference is that by the end of my life, I will literally have experienced it, rather than just seen pictures of it!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le16ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn10le16ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Future Perfect", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the<span class=\"strong\"> Future Perfect</span> tense to talk about an event that will have happened before another one in the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Structure:<br/><span class=\"italic\">will have</span> + past participle", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">By the time she finishes university, she will have catalogued every outfit she has worn. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "With the <span class=\"strong\">Future Perfect Continuous</span>, an action in the future is unfinished by the time another action in the future starts. It is most often used with an expression of time.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Structure:<br/>subject + <span class=\"italic\">will have been</span> + present participle", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">By graduation day, she'll have been tweeting about every class she has ever been to.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "By the time she finishes university, she will have catalogued every outfit she has worn.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "By graduation day, she'll have been tweeting about every class, or function she had been to. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She will have been posting pictures of every beau, complete with comments for years by then. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Unreal Conditional: Expressing Causal Connections ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Unreal Conditional to express a relationship between a cause and an effect in a hypothetical way.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">If it was not for</span> + noun phrase to say that one situation depends on another situation or person to come true. You use <span class=\"italic\">If it weren't for ...</span> if you want to express yourself more formally.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">If it weren't for the stress people put on documenting their every move, they would be living their lives.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If you want to make a causal connection to a past situation, you can use <span class=\"italic\">If it had not</span>/<span class=\"italic\">hadn't been for</span> + noun phrase.<br/>In a formal context you can use <span class=\"italic\">Had it not been ...</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Were it not for ...</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Were it not for the Internet, these children would be playing outside.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If it weren't for the need to demonstrate what they were doing or seeing rather than just doing or seeing, everything would be different.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Had it not been ingrained in them, children wouldn't be snapping cell phone selfies of themselves with friends and texting about it rather than speaking to them.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I would have been part of this trend but for the constant assertion of my parents that I should not be tempted to publish my life to the world.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Have a look at some social media pages and take notes on what you see and read there.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "What can you infer about the page owner by looking at their social interactions?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "How do others interact with them?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "How important is what they say to each other? ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write non-subjective statements about what you see.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "State your perception about what will have happened to those pages by the end of the decade.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I make a critical assessment of people's social media pages.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I state whether there is too little or too much information about the people available on the pages.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make inferences about people\u00b4s traits through social media pages.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make non-subjective statements about what I see.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use the Future Perfect tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my ideas.", "type": "text"}]}]}